804
00:55:30,993 --> 00:55:32,327
Vivian.

805
00:55:33,829 --> 00:55:36,331
Maybe you just think
you saw something.

806
00:55:36,732 --> 00:55:38,533
Maybe you were sleepwalking.

807
00:55:38,535 --> 00:55:39,668
No.

808
00:55:39,670 --> 00:55:41,403
