923
01:02:35,552 --> 01:02:37,885
I think it's for people
who want to trudge ahead,

924
01:02:37,887 --> 01:02:39,687
or somebody that wants to

925
01:02:39,689 --> 01:02:41,923
go further than they
probably should go.

926
01:02:41,925 --> 01:02:43,491
