966
01:05:41,670 --> 01:05:42,770
Me?

967
01:05:42,971 --> 01:05:44,672
No. I didn't notice anything.

968
01:05:46,108 --> 01:05:47,542
You mean to tell me
that you didn't notice

969
01:05:47,544 --> 01:05:50,611
