her ruin this for me.

1024
01:08:37,913 --> 01:08:39,046
For us.

1025
01:08:39,048 --> 01:08:41,082
You don't have
to worry about her.

1026
01:08:41,084 --> 01:08:42,750
She's not going to say anything.

1027
01:08:42,752 --> 01:08:43,684
Yeah?

1028
01:08:44,086 --> 01:08:45,252
