There...

1045
01:09:48,584 --> 01:09:50,050
There must be
something about them.

1046
01:09:50,052 --> 01:09:51,819
Some radiation.

1047
01:09:51,821 --> 01:09:54,188
They're causing hallucinations!

1048
01:09:54,190 --> 01:09:55,823
